stormnic-mlx4
=============

An original Rust implementation, licensed MIT (see LICENSE).

Acknowledgement: the hardware facts in docs/spec/connectx3.md (register,
command and mailbox layouts, field offsets and bit widths, opcodes, constants
and command sequences for the Mellanox/NVIDIA ConnectX-3 and ConnectX-3 Pro)
were learned from these drivers (dual GPL-2 / OpenIB.org BSD):

  - Linux: drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx4/ and include/linux/mlx4/
    (torvalds/linux, commits 6f8319e3e9a4 and 69f80fef3153)
  - FreeBSD: sys/dev/mlx4/ (freebsd/freebsd-src, commits 669cd0d90ee7 and
    274236ed084a)

No source code was copied; the driver is a rewrite, and docs/spec/ describes
the hardware in its own words.
